# PROJECT.md

After any requested change to Grow a Sushi Empire (Studio scripts, instances, config, or this repo), update `PROJECT.md` in the same turn so it matches the live game.

- Edit only the sections the change affects: plots, levels/XP, restaurant tiers, economy, rods, shops, town/NPCs, UI, fish images, scripts, remotes, and saving.
- Record the values the game actually uses. If `EconomyConfig` overwrites another module at runtime, document the `EconomyConfig` numbers.
- Commit `PROJECT.md` (and this rule, if it changed) after the update. Do not commit secrets or unrelated files.
- Skip the commit only when the user explicitly says not to commit.
